---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
    <div class="w-full max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-lg py-5xl">
        <h1 class="text-display-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-md">Privacy Policy</h1>
        
        <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-body-md text-body space-y-md">
            <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
            
            <p>At TF Aadhaar Cropper (techilyfly.com/tools/tfaadhaarcropper), accessible from our website, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information that is collected and recorded by TF Aadhaar Cropper and how we use it.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink mt-xl mb-xs">1. Absolute Data Privacy (Browser-Only Processing)</h2>
            <p><strong>We do NOT upload, store, or transmit your Aadhaar Card files or passwords to any server.</strong> All PDF parsing, image extraction, cropping, and downloading happen entirely within your local web browser. Your sensitive documents remain safely on your device.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink mt-xl mb-xs">2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We may collect generic, non-personally identifiable information (such as browser type, operating system, and anonymous usage statistics) to maintain and improve our Dashboard and service reliability.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink mt-xl mb-xs">3. Log Files</h2>
            <p>TF Aadhaar Cropper follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink mt-xl mb-xs">4. Google DoubleClick DART Cookie (AdSense)</h2>
            <p>Google is one of a third-party vendor on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to our site and other sites on the internet. However, visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL – <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a></p>
            
            <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink mt-xl mb-xs">5. Contact Information</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions or suggestions about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at <strong>support@techilyfly.com</strong>.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
